# Fabulus RPG Seed

After modifying Fabulus RPG catalog data, always run the database seed before finishing the task.

## When to run

Run the seed when any of these change:

- `db/fabulus_seed.sql`, `db/fabulus-extended-seed.sql`, or `db/fabulus_schema.sql`
- `src/game/fabulus/data/mockData.ts`, `extendedItems.ts`, or `data/fabulus-extended.json`
- Fabulus mock item/loot data in `server/fabulus-routes.js`

If you regenerate SQL from JSON, run the seed after that too.

## Command

```bash
node scripts/seed-rpg.js
```

Uses `DATABASE_RPG_URL` from `.env`. Do not skip this step unless the user explicitly says not to seed.

## After seeding

Confirm key counts when relevant: `rpg_items` should match the catalog (currently 50), and `rpg_loot_tables` should include extended entries.
